      "side": 1,
      "message": "prefer: `HashMap\u003cCallbackId, Vec\u003cScannerInfo\u003e\u003e`. Makes disconnect much simpler and is probably better in the long run.\n\nSince you need to look up by uuid too, you could have another map of active registrations `HashMap\u003cUuid, CallbackId\u003e` which you remove from on success/failure.",
      "revId": "1664e0de76c765f8c61bbb87728ac811461e5fde",
